t space-y-2"><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 transition-colors group-hover:text-indigo-600 dark:text-slate-100 dark:group-hover:text-indigo-400">URL Heading Extractor</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Extract and analyze headings from any URL - Check SEO, Open Graph, Twitter Cards</p></div></a><a href="/url-to-ip" class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_10px_25px_-5px_rgba(79,70,229,0.15)] dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"><div class="mb-4 flex w-full items-center justify-between"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 transition-colors group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-indigo-400 dark:group-hover:bg-indigo-600 dark:group-hover:text-white"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-8 w-8" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 22C6.47715 22 2 17.5228 2 12C2 6.47715 6.47715 2 12 2C17.5228 2 22 6.47715 22 12C22 17.5228 17.5228 22 12 22ZM9.71002 19.6674C8.74743 17.6259 8.15732 15.3742 8.02731 13H4.06189C4.458 16.1765 6.71639 18.7747 9.71002 19.6674ZM10.0307 13C10.1811 15.4388 10.8778 17.7297 12 19.752C13.1222 17.7297 13.8189 15.4388 13.9693 13H10.0307ZM19.9381 13H15.9727C15.8427 15.3742 15.2526 17.6259 14.29 19.6674C17.2836 18.7747 19.542 16.1765 19.9381 13ZM4.06189 11H8.02731C8.15732 8.62577 8.74743 6.37407 9.71002 4.33256C6.71639 5.22533 4.458 7.8235 4.06189 11ZM10.0307 11H13.9693C13.8189 8.56122 13.1222 6.27025 12 4.24799C10.8778 6.27025 10.1811 8.56122 10.0307 11ZM14.29 4.33256C15.2526 6.37407 15.8427 8.62577 15.9727 11H19.9381C19.542 7.8235 17.2836 5.22533 14.29 4.33256Z"></path></svg></div><span class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-900/30 dark:text-emerald-400">NEW</span></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start space-y-2"><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 transition-colors group-hover:text-indigo-600 dark:text-slate-100 dark:group-hover:text-indigo-400">URL to IP</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Resolve any URL into public IPv4 and IPv6 addresses with secure DNS filtering</p></div></a></div></div></section><section id="introduce" class="overflow-hidden py-24 lg:py-32"><div class="container px-4 md:px-6"><div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20"><div class="perspective-[2000px] group relative"><div class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-violet-500 opacity-20 blur-xl transition duration-500 group-hover:opacity-40"></div><div class="relative transform transition-transform duration-500"><img src="/imgs/features/what-is-url-to-any.jpg" alt="Feature visualization" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white object-cover shadow-2xl dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col lg:text-left"><h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50 lg:text-4xl">What is URL to Any</h2><p class="mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">URL to Any is a powerful set of tools that lets you convert any webpage into various formats for easy saving, sharing, and reference.</p><ul class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-y-6"><li class="flex gap-4"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 dark:bg-indigo-900/20 dark:text-indigo-400"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-6" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 22H4C3.44772 22 3 21.5523 3 21V3C3 2.44772 3.44772 2 4 2H20C20.5523 2 21 2.44772 21 3V21C21 21.5523 20.5523 22 20 22ZM19 20V4H5V20H19ZM8 7H16V9H8V7ZM8 11H16V13H8V11ZM8 15H16V17H8V15Z"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Multiple Conversion Options</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Convert URLs to Markdown, PDF, images, text, and more with a single click.</p></div></li><li class="flex gap-4"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 dark:bg-indigo-900/20 dark:text-indigo-400"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-6" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 8H19V5H5V8ZM14 19V10H5V19H14ZM16 19H19V10H16V19ZM4 3H20C20.5523 3 21 3.44772 21 4V20C21 20.5523 20.5523 21 20 21H4C3.44772 21 3 20.5523 3 20V4C3 3.44772 3.44772 3 4 3Z"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Easy to Use Interface</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Simple, intuitive design makes converting web content effortless.</p></div></li><li class="flex gap-4"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 dark:bg-indigo-900/20 dark:text-indigo-400"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-6" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M13 10H20L11 23V14H4L13 1V10Z"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Instant Processing</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Get your converted content in seconds with our optimized processing engine.</p></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section id="benefit" class="bg-slate-50 py-24 dark:bg-slate-950/50 lg:py-32"><div class="container px-4 md:px-6"><div class="mx-auto grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20"><div><span class="mb-4 inline-flex rounded-full border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:border-indigo-800 dark:bg-indigo-950/50 dark:text-indigo-300">Benefits</span><h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50 lg:text-4xl">Why Choose URL to Any</h2><p class="mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Save time and effort with our comprehensive URL conversion tools designed for everyday use.</p><div class="space-y-4"><button type="button" class="w-full rounded-xl border px-4 text-left transition-all duration-200 border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-md dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 py-4"><div class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 dark:bg-indigo-900/30 dark:text-indigo-400"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 19V13H17V19H19V7.82843L16.1716 5H5V19H7ZM4 3H17L21 7V20C21 20.5523 20.5523 21 20 21H4C3.44772 21 3 20.5523 3 20V4C3 3.44772 3.44772 3 4 3ZM9 15V19H15V15H9Z"></path></svg></div><span class="text-lg font-bold transition-colors text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50">Save Web Content Easily</span></div><div class="pb-4 pl-[3.5rem] pr-4 text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Quickly save important web content in your preferred format without complex software.<div class="mt-4 h-1 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-violet-500"></div></div></div></button><button type="button" class="w-full rounded-xl border px-4 text-left transition-all duration-200 border-slate-200 bg-transparent hover:bg-white/70 dark:borde