"mb-2 font-bold transition-colors text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">Paste Your URL</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Copy the web address of the page you want to convert and paste it into our tool.</p></div></div></button><button type="button" class="group w-full rounded-xl border p-6 text-left transition-all duration-300 border-transparent hover:border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:border-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-900"><div class="flex gap-4"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><span class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 font-bold transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200 text-slate-500 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-400">2</span></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 font-bold transition-colors text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Choose Your Format</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Select from Markdown, PDF, text, image, or other available formats for conversion.</p></div></div></button><button type="button" class="group w-full rounded-xl border p-6 text-left transition-all duration-300 border-transparent hover:border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:border-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-900"><div class="flex gap-4"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><span class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 font-bold transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200 text-slate-500 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-400">3</span></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 font-bold transition-colors text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Get Your Result</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Click convert and instantly receive your content in the selected format.</p></div></div></button><button type="button" class="group w-full rounded-xl border p-6 text-left transition-all duration-300 border-transparent hover:border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:border-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-900"><div class="flex gap-4"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><span class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 font-bold transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200 text-slate-500 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-400">4</span></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 font-bold transition-colors text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Download or Copy</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Download your converted file or copy the content directly to your clipboard.</p></div></div></button></div><div class="relative min-h-[400px] flex-1"><div class="group relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-2xl dark:border-slate-800"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-500/10 to-violet-500/10 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><img src="/imgs/features/paste-your-url.jpg" alt="Paste Your URL" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105"/></div></div></div></div></section><section id="feature" class="bg-slate-50/50 py-24 dark:bg-slate-950/50 lg:py-32"><div class="container px-4 md:px-6"><div class="mx-auto mb-16 flex max-w-3xl flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50 lg:text-4xl">Why Choose URL to Any</h2><p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Powerful tools to streamline your web content conversion workflow</p></div><div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="group flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_10px_25px_-5px_rgba(79,70,229,0.15)] dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"><div class="mb-6 flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 transition-colors group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:tex