mber-400 text-amber-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg></div></div><q class="block leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Clean interface, fast conversion, and best of all - completely free. Such a great tool!</q></div></div></div></div></section><section id="faq" class="bg-slate-50/50 py-24 dark:bg-slate-950/50 lg:py-32"><div class="container px-4 md:px-6"><div class="mx-auto mb-16 max-w-3xl text-center"><span class="mb-4 inline-flex rounded-full border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:border-indigo-800 dark:bg-indigo-950/50 dark:text-indigo-300">FAQ</span><h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50 lg:text-4xl">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Have another question? Contact us via email or social media.</p></div><div class="mx-auto grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-8"><div class="group flex gap-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 font-bold text-indigo-600 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white dark:bg-indigo-900/20 dark:text-indigo-400">1</span><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Is URL to Any completely free?</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Yes, URL to Any is 100% free to use with no hidden fees or subscriptions. We believe in providing useful tools without barriers.</p></div></div><div class="group flex gap-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 font-bold text-indigo-600 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white dark:bg-indigo-900/20 dark:text-indigo-400">2</span><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">How secure is my data when using URL to Any?</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We take security seriously. All processing happens securely in the cloud, and we never store the content of the webpages you convert or any personal information.</p></div></div><div class="group flex gap-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 font-bold text-indigo-600 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white dark:bg-indigo-900/20 dark:text-indigo-400">3</span><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">What&#x27;s the maximum file size I can convert?</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Our standard conversion works for most webpages. For very large or complex pages, there may be some limitations in certain formats. We&#x27;re constantly improving our processing capabilities.</p></div></div><div class="group flex gap-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 font-bold text-indigo-600 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white dark:bg-indigo-900/20 dark:text-indigo-400">4</span><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Can I convert pages behind logins or paywalls?</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Our tool can only convert publicly accessible webpages. Content behind logins, paywalls, or requiring authentication cannot be converted due to security and privacy reasons.</p></div></div><div class="group flex gap-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 font-bold text-indigo-600 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white dark:bg-indigo-900/20 dark:text-indigo-400">5</span><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">What formats can I convert URLs to?</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We currently support conversion to PDF, Markdown, Text, Images, JSON, XML, and several other formats. We&#x27;re always adding new options based on user feedback.</p></div></div><div class="group flex gap-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 font-bold text-indigo-600 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white dark:bg-indigo-900/20 dark:text-indigo-400">6</span><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Can I use URL to Any on my mobile device?</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Absolutely! URL to Any is fully responsive and works on any device with a web browser, including smartphones and tablets.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="cta" class="py-24 lg:py-32"><div class="container px-4 md:px-6"><div cla